### Sattadhar Textile — Auth + RBAC
### VS Code "REST Client" extension (humao.rest-client). Run requests top to bottom.

@base = http://localhost:4000
@api = {{base}}/api/v1

### ─── 0. Health (public) ────────────────────────────────────────────────
GET {{base}}/health

### ─── 1. Login as ADMIN ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
# @name adminLogin
POST {{api}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "admin", "password": "ChangeMe@123" }

###
@adminAccess = {{adminLogin.response.body.data.accessToken}}
@adminRefresh = {{adminLogin.response.body.data.refreshToken}}

### ─── 2. Login as STAFF ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
# @name staffLogin
POST {{api}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "kirti", "password": "Staff@123" }

###
@staffAccess = {{staffLogin.response.body.data.accessToken}}
@staffRefresh = {{staffLogin.response.body.data.refreshToken}}

### ─── 3. Who am I (STAFF) ───────────────────────────────────────────────
GET {{api}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{staffAccess}}

### ─── 4. Wrong password → 401 INVALID_CREDENTIALS ───────────────────────
POST {{api}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "meera", "password": "definitely-wrong" }

### ─── 5. Unknown username → identical 401 (no enumeration) ──────────────
POST {{api}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "ghost", "password": "definitely-wrong" }

### ─── 6. Lockout — send this 5 times → 5th returns 423 ACCOUNT_LOCKED ───
POST {{api}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "meera", "password": "definitely-wrong" }

### ─── 7. Correct password while locked → still 423 ──────────────────────
POST {{api}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "meera", "password": "Staff@123" }

### ─── 8. Refresh → new access token, same session ───────────────────────
POST {{api}}/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{ "refreshToken": "{{staffRefresh}}" }

### ─── 9. RBAC: STAFF hits an ADMIN-only route → 403 FORBIDDEN ───────────
POST {{api}}/auth/admin/reset-password
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{staffAccess}}

{ "userId": "00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000000", "newPassword": "Brand@New1" }

### ─── 10. No token at all → 401 UNAUTHENTICATED (not 403) ───────────────
POST {{api}}/auth/admin/reset-password
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userId": "00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000000", "newPassword": "Brand@New1" }

### ─── 11. ADMIN unlocks meera by resetting her password ─────────────────
# Replace <MEERA_ID> — get it from psql:
#   select id, username from users;
POST {{api}}/auth/admin/reset-password
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccess}}

{ "userId": "<MEERA_ID>", "newPassword": "Brand@New1" }

### ─── 12. Weak password → 400 VALIDATION_ERROR ──────────────────────────
POST {{api}}/auth/admin/reset-password
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccess}}

{ "userId": "<MEERA_ID>", "newPassword": "short" }

### ─── 13. Logout this session ───────────────────────────────────────────
POST {{api}}/auth/logout
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{staffAccess}}

{}

### ─── 14. Same access token after logout → 401 TOKEN_REVOKED ────────────
GET {{api}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{staffAccess}}

### ─── 15. Refresh with the revoked jti → 401 TOKEN_REVOKED ──────────────
POST {{api}}/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{ "refreshToken": "{{staffRefresh}}" }
